sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Camera
  participant W as Analytics worker (edge)
  participant B as Valkey Streams
  participant A as API / alert engine
  participant D as PostgreSQL + PostGIS
  participant M as MinIO
  participant U as Console (operator)

  C->>W: frames (RTSP/TCP)
  Note over W: timing from PTS, never arrival time<br/>declared FPS measured, not trusted
  W->>W: detect, track, select best shot
  W->>M: PUT crop bytes
  W->>B: XADD sighting {track, pts, bbox, crop uri}
  W->>B: XADD plate_read {text, confidence, crop uri}
  B->>A: consumer group reads
  A->>D: INSERT sighting, plate read (normalised text)
  A->>A: watchlist correlate — exact, then fuzzy (max_distance 2.0)
  alt hit
    A->>D: INSERT alert (severity, dedupe key)
    A-->>U: SSE push to the alert queue
    U->>A: GET /evidence/crop?uri=... (session cookie, role checked)
    A->>M: fetch object
    M-->>A: bytes
    A-->>U: image bytes, same origin
    U->>A: verdict (true/false positive)
    A->>D: append to hash-chained audit log
  else no hit
    A->>D: sighting retained for trace and retention clock only
  end
